sequenceDiagram
  actor Child as Child reader
  participant UI as Reading canvas
  participant API as Next.js API
  participant Q as Trigger.dev task
  participant ASR as Speech / alignment layer
  participant Agent as Judgement agent
  participant Policy as Policy guardrails
  participant DB as Postgres + Storage
  actor Tutor as Teacher / SET

  Child->>UI: Select approved passage
  UI->>API: Create session + signed upload URL
  API->>DB: Record consent, passage, learner context
  Child->>UI: Read aloud + optional self-flag
  UI->>DB: Upload audio to private bucket
  UI->>API: Complete session
  API->>Q: Trigger idempotent analysis task
  Q->>ASR: Transcribe / align known text
  ASR-->>Q: Word timings, phoneme evidence, confidence
  Q->>Agent: Analyse event candidates
  Agent->>Policy: Request bounded action
  Policy-->>Agent: Allow prompt, model, silent, or escalate
  Agent->>DB: Store trace + running-record event
  DB-->>Tutor: Realtime record update
  Tutor->>DB: Inspect audio + override if needed
  DB-->>Agent: Store labelled correction / override
  Agent-->>UI: Show child-safe feedback or silence state
